# func/lookup/lk_tv (id 368): text compare, packed word i of Y arrived (x0).
# ky = KEY(x0 if 3 i < len(Y) else 0); d = L5 - ky. d != 0, or 3 (i + 1) >= max(la, ly): T6 = sign(d) -> lk_upd (364).
# Else L2 = i + 1, read word i + 1 of A at L0 + 3 + i -> lk_tw (367).
# Note: weights/func/lookup/core.md (text ordering compare, KEY block as in lk_tw).
input 65
slice 0 0 1                       # v1 [x0]
